BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:turkey-turkey-charles-20270417@md-hunting-calendars
DTSTAMP:20260813T212152Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270417
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270418
SUMMARY:Turkey - A/F
DESCRIPTION:Junior Hunt Day. Legal devices: crossbow\, vertical bow\, and
  arrow/bolt-shooting air guns (A)\; shotgun (#4 shot or smaller) or arrow
 /bolt-shooting air gun (F). 1 bearded turkey\; counts toward the Spring S
 eason bag limit (2/season). Hunters age 16 or younger only\, accompanied 
 by an unarmed adult 21+ with a valid MD hunting license (Apprentice licen
 se does not qualify). Shooting hours: 1/2 hour before sunrise to sunset. 
 It is illegal to hunt turkeys with the aid of bait\, or to use dogs or or
 ganized drives.
CLASS:PRIVATE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-INTENDEDSTATUS:FREE
X-APPLE-CALENDAR-COLOR:#006400
CATEGORIES:Hunting,Wild Turkey
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:turkey-turkey-charles-20270418@md-hunting-calendars
DTSTAMP:20260813T212152Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270418
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270419
SUMMARY:Turkey - A/F
DESCRIPTION:Junior Hunt Day. Legal devices: crossbow\, vertical bow\, and
  arrow/bolt-shooting air guns (A)\; shotgun (#4 shot or smaller) or arrow
 /bolt-shooting air gun (F). 1 bearded turkey\; counts toward the Spring S
 eason bag limit (2/season). Hunters age 16 or younger only\, accompanied 
 by an unarmed adult 21+ with a valid MD hunting license (Apprentice licen
 se does not qualify). Shooting hours: 1/2 hour before sunrise to sunset. 
 It is illegal to hunt turkeys with the aid of bait\, or to use dogs or or
 ganized drives. Sunday hunting land access: Private land only. Sunday sho
 oting hours are the same as Monday through Saturday.
CLASS:PRIVATE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-INTENDEDSTATUS:FREE
X-APPLE-CALENDAR-COLOR:#006400
