DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270419
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270420
SUMMARY:Turkey - A/F
DESCRIPTION:Spring Season. Legal devices: crossbow\, vertical bow\, and a
 rrow/bolt-shooting air guns (A)\; shotgun (#4 shot or smaller) or arrow/b
 olt-shooting air gun (F). 1 bearded turkey per day\, 2 bearded turkeys fo
 r the season. Shooting hours: 1/2 hour before sunrise to noon. It is ille
 gal to hunt turkeys with the aid of bait\, or to use dogs or organized dr
 ives.
