 olt-shooting air gun (F). 1 bearded turkey per day\, 2 bearded turkeys fo
 r the season. Shooting hours: 1/2 hour before sunrise to sunset. It is il
 legal to hunt turkeys with the aid of bait\, or to use dogs or organized 
 drives.
